# Copy to CNAME (no extension) when your custom domain is ready.
# File must contain a single hostname, e.g.:
# www.yourdomain.com
#
# Vite copies public/CNAME into dist/ on build so GitHub Pages picks it up.
# Also set the same domain in GitHub → Settings → Pages → Custom domain,
# and point DNS (CNAME www → YOUR_USER.github.io). See README.
